      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JAYJAYBENNY (3) made it four wins on the trot at this venue when he led from wider and dug deep to get home by a head over this distance last start. Has had seven weeks off since but was kept up to the mark with a trial. Has the speed to take advantage of the low draw so can pick up where he left off. ARNIES ARMY NZ (10) has been performing well from this row, racing parked when third last start after scoring at the previous appearance at this circuit and distance. Primary contender. IM LORD TOMMY (2) is much better served by the ace draw after coming from the back row last time and won twice in a row here prior. VINCENTIUS MAXIMUS (11) cops a tricky draw but hit his peak with a third-up win at Newcastle last week. With even luck he could go on with it.",
